
Composite: Given I navigate to the SauceDemo website homepage
Given I am on main application page
When I wait until element located by `caseSensitiveText(Swag Labs)` appears
Then `${current-page-url}` is equal to `https://www.saucedemo.com/`

Composite: When I log in as a user with username: $username and password: $password
When I add `<username>` to field located by `id(user-name)`
When I add `<password>` to field located by `id(password)`
When I click on element located by `name(login-button)`
Then `${current-page-url}` is equal to `https://www.saucedemo.com/inventory.html`